---
import { Factory, TrendingUp, ShieldCheck, Leaf, Award, Cpu } from 'lucide-react';
---

<section id="scale" class="py-20 bg-[#081726] border-t border-[#2E87C6]/20 relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-6 mb-16 border-b border-[#2E87C6]/20 pb-8">
      <div>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#4DA6E8] uppercase tracking-wider block mb-2">
          COMMERCIAL SCALE &amp; OPERATIONAL CAPACITY
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white font-['Outfit']">
          Engineered for National Scale
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 max-w-md font-sans">
        Giga Mines transitions critical minerals from laboratory curiosity into India's largest commercial-scale refining infrastructure.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Big Numbers Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <!-- Metric 1 -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-[#0D2237] border border-[#2E87C6]/30 relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-[#EE7B2B] transition-colors">
        <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
          FACILITY INVESTMENT
        </div>
        <div class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white font-['Outfit'] tracking-tight group-hover:text-[#EE7B2B] transition-colors">
          ₹350<span class="text-2xl text-[#EE7B2B]">Cr</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mt-3 font-sans">
          Signed MoU with the Karnataka government to set up India's premier critical minerals complex.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-[#2E87C6]/20 text-[10px] font-mono text-[#4DA6E8]">
          STATUS: IN COMMISSIONING
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Metric 2 -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-[#0D2237] border border-[#2E87C6]/30 relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-[#EE7B2B] transition-colors">
        <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
          ANNUAL RECYCLING CAPACITY
        </div>
        <div class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white font-['Outfit'] tracking-tight group-hover:text-[#EE7B2B] transition-colors">
          20,000<span class="text-xl text-[#2E87C6]">TPA</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mt-3 font-sans">
          Black mass and decommissioned EV battery pack processing capacity at full giga-scale output.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-[#2E87C6]/20 text-[10px] font-mono text-[#4DA6E8]">
          FEED: BLACK MASS &amp; MAGNETS
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Metric 3 -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-[#0D2237] border border-[#2E87C6]/30 relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-[#EE7B2B] transition-colors">
        <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
          REFINED PRODUCT PURITY
        </div>
        <div class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white font-['Outfit'] tracking-tight group-hover:text-[#EE7B2B] transition-colors">
          99.85<span class="text-2xl text-emerald-400">%</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mt-3 font-sans">
          Battery-grade Lithium Carbonate, Cobalt Sulfate, and Nickel Sulfate meeting global cell specs.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-[#2E87C6]/20 text-[10px] font-mono text-emerald-400">
          ICP-OES CERTIFIED &lt; 10 PPM
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Metric 4 -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-[#0D2237] border border-[#2E87C6]/30 relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-[#EE7B2B] transition-colors">
        <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
          CARBON INTENSITY REDUCTION
        </div>
        <div class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white font-['Outfit'] tracking-tight group-hover:text-[#EE7B2B] transition-colors">
          -84<span class="text-2xl text-emerald-400">%</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mt-3 font-sans">
          Reduction in life-cycle CO2 footprint compared to virgin mineral extraction and smelting.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-[#2E87C6]/20 text-[10px] font-mono text-[#EE7B2B]">
          100% ZLD SYSTEM
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
